    See LICENSE.

rAthena
    https://github.com/rathena/rathena
    Copyright (c) the rAthena development team.
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

    rAthena owns the game database this panel reads and writes: the login,
    char, guild, party, inventory, log and item/mob tables and their column
    definitions. No rAthena source or SQL file is redistributed here. The
    emulator's schema is a dependency, not part of this project.

